{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sulo the Sidekick (Demo)\u00a0</strong>is a playful desktop companion that lives right on your desktop. Pick a career for Sulo. He works while you do your thing and rests when you do. Remember to take care of well-being \u2014 yours too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751120/extras/Work.gif?t=1748360486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a cozy glimpse into the full game with core features like career progression, wellness tracking, and stress-reducing items. You're welcome to enjoy it forever as a relaxing desktop companion. Keep it on top or behind your favorite apps so you can check in on Sulo anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Built-in Screen Time Tracker</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Understand your habits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track daily breaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Promotes balance &amp; focus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wellness Through Items</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Sulo's earnings to buy items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item helps reduce stress buildup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn benefits through friendly tooltips</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751120?t=1748360486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751120?t=1748360486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751120/d790b0e8a8f3b96da58ce998194e39f9feaa5283/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748360486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751120/d790b0e8a8f3b96da58ce